three points of AC to rust monsters, which would still leave you with
plenty enough AC for well into Gehennom. Really, continuing to altar
camp is just wasting time and food and risking a stupid accident for no
gain.

	Though even a human sacrifice accident wouldn't hurt you too
badly. You look capable of taking Yeenoghu in a straight-up fight at
this point (if you put on your magic resistance!), and you're certainly
capable of taking Juiblex apart (just watch the Illness).

> So, what have I screwed up (a wish for the amulet of
